      "narration_id": "S02",
      "target_start": 6,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.251,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.749
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "石川和门田早就认识，犬饲是后来才搬进来的那个。",
      "sha256": "f4c50aa4aa158d6b841694d31c7909244201dee08f747cee5bd82a9dbfa8dc15",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S03",
      "target_start": 12,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.251,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.749
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "三个人挤在一间屋里，谁说了算，很快就分出了高下。",
      "sha256": "2a7c5edd9209f92c2feff3f58ff43565a4573dc50834a7e4c573d6882c9a87db",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S04",
      "target_start": 18,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.937,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.063
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "后来搬进来的犬饲，慢慢成了屋里被使唤、被拿钱的人。",
      "sha256": "a83ee9b1c9b66c1ff8962268845e1c2024193243b8653c7eb0fae5abcb7fef94",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S05",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.355,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.645
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "二〇一九年二月，三十一岁的犬饲，死在了这间屋里。",
      "sha256": "9f27544ada80469546d3070965a004aa95cbaf23b43fc6b39c4bea7da0524b56",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S06",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.538,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.462
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "解剖报告写的死因是头部外伤，她身上另有多处瘀伤。",
      "sha256": "46119a9cefaa07608041f67c79e44f6309627808e973ed9f9164637acc0e740a",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S07",
      "target_start": 36,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.956,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.044
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "二月四日前后，同屋的另外两个女人，把遗体运进山里。",
      "sha256": "248ec3e48770462be1b574ffbe6d9be9e0a3727f9d77c94530175a84233c7622",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S08",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.433,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.567
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "二十天后的清晨五点四十分，一个熟人拨通了报警电话。",
      "sha256": "9b5f952925664dabf23c3d135a501453b4c3492feb3697c6b5b21c8c0299338f",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S09",
      "target_start": 48,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.46,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.54
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "警方在山里找到遗体，石川和门田双双因弃尸被捕。",
      "sha256": "5958f3a266e20525a6d9d39cff5a3a1cd4c98f2287160164187b87e8e9a6355a",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S10",
      "target_start": 54,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.251,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.749
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "二〇二〇年七月，名古屋地方法院开庭审理这起案子。",
      "sha256": "b55ea7817639912a1b90fe2c904abee1583b14cbd5fc741758214bb04515314f",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S11",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.355,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.645
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "伤害致死这一项，石川和门田两个人，法院都判了无罪。",
      "sha256": "b6b168201f760726c2490ff059853997e4b61d2019cabe69f4ff8bf92cbe2b7d",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S12",
      "target_start": 66,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.06,
      "atempo": 1.0101,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "谁动的手，能证明的几乎只有门田自己的那段供述。",
      "sha256": "20b60b24968b1bc1ab74cb5148ec447791260550ce107d5932e779a8e3d5008b",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S13",
      "target_start": 72,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.329,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.671
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "可这段供述前后不一，法院没有采信，所以没有认定。",
      "sha256": "8aa29237fe0a88643d6970aed70540fcd18ab82441f29f77421cce363031dedf",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S14",
      "target_start": 78,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.348,
      "atempo": 1.058,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "弃尸和盗窃成立，两人都是缓刑四年，判决同月确定。",
      "sha256": "a6cfcb57be18abb41eab39195a28bbc3706f941f1aca4c92cb9988caed5ca033",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S15",
      "target_start": 84,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.747,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.253
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "两年多以后的春天，四十岁的门田典子，也从家里消失了。",
      "sha256": "6bf8658dd659fc66a65f8fad54619cc848c8391862683765dd93b409400f9d88",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S16",
      "target_start": 90,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.669,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.331
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "带走她的不是同屋的人，是天池由佳理和山下克己。",
      "sha256": "e28803f4d1009fb63617b8e0770a19c7db23d5b3dd9dc51e89539edf66f37960",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S17",
      "target_start": 96,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.46,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.54
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "检方说，天池和山下以讨债为名要钱，门田拿不出来。",
      "sha256": "3fed8e1b75df91314a4aced0ffbf3494057a294599234f347a7d13d949f56bfc",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S18",
      "target_start": 102,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.747,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.253
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "三月十五日前后，在一辆停着的车里，她停止了呼吸。",
      "sha256": "79ac5251705ee376de9c367bdf29fcb6f9b0b991e021d67c633b7aa9527d05f8",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S19",
