      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.355,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.645
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "第二天，她被埋进东浦町的农田，身边只有土和水沟。",
      "sha256": "a905a9eedaa7ebdabdd534a83bd58ab43a5439b00303022f7875b8662bf75080",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S20",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.669,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.331
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "这起案子能曝光，是因为天池和山下先因另一起案件被捕。",
      "sha256": "8f73744b83535de9167eb1894f2fa091cc249f548b1e4a6c8755d71ca74303f1",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S21",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.937,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.063
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "审讯中天池说出遗体下落，四月四日，警方在农田找到她。",
      "sha256": "18428cb4bc197f62b1d6860a264af3014fa9d6169a15e696252519acf3d80b02",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S22",
      "target_start": 126,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.538,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.462
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "二〇二四年三月，天池由佳理被判有期徒刑十六年。",
      "sha256": "7cfa4f40dc0edb9283905f9656f475ea8cbe4837acfb425078ea25995c938283",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S23",
      "target_start": 132,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.355,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.645
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "同年七月，山下克己被判二十八年，他否认也没用。",
      "sha256": "0e9cb679a006928723b0dacb0fee4bc01fcca06a4a802ae29fba595b5c5c15e9",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S24",
      "target_start": 138,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.06,
      "atempo": 1.0101,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "两人都上诉，二审都维持原判。天池的案子，还在最高法院。",
      "sha256": "2ea35e1b208551ca94d33c2c68b0b2a5dc79babdd196f2dbc8e383a115072c3a",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S25",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.139,
      "atempo": 1.0231,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "两起案子只隔着一个门田典子，其余的人不是同一批。",
      "sha256": "f98849109770639be91d69b883a572d2d9efeae5d6ae39b7d9e91a9d8762c9de",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S26",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.269,
      "atempo": 1.0449,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "二〇一九年她帮着埋了同屋的犬饲，三年后她自己被埋。",
      "sha256": "c80328cf5bf3574ed505d80fd52464ab158604396d481a61d1d00e3dde6094a1",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S27",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.348,
      "atempo": 1.058,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "网上很多人说这就是因果报应，谁也躲不过去，传得很广。",
      "sha256": "1476d67af33923eb5646ea7c6e995e59a07762d8de1f9c3cd8e69caf47f6dd5a",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S28",
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.139,
      "atempo": 1.0231,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
